{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_06",
  "title": "灯火闪烁不定",
  "storyCode": "BB-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7292d7668d3fc52878c4d9269edbdf1c365e6f4cefa83ea18e0299c9c92a0ddb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一块源石结晶安静地躺在试验台上，在灯光下泛起橙黄色的光。\n它看上去纯净、美丽、无害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "普瑞赛斯......我们究竟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g6_rmbtmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "speakerId": "avg_230_savage_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遗憾......这是不可能的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g4_rmbtwild_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......身上......好疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂死的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感......谢......您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "坐在台前的人拿起了源石结晶，插入了自己的手臂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瘦削的手臂上鲜血淋漓，但除了多出一道血肉模糊的伤口，什么都没有发生。\n痛感逐渐清晰起来。\n可这不是被源石感染的痛。\n检测仪器也清楚地显示，细胞和源石没有任何融合的迹象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......源石不会感染我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们可曾想到这其中的痛苦会是这样的模样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是你，你打算怎么评判这片大地的现状呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知语言）“源石”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知语言）我们唯一延续的——灯火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（平稳的呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生效了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "效率比过去的抑制剂高出几倍。阿米娅血液里源石结晶密度也有明显下降。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还只是实验性质的。我还没找到能在泰拉量产的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你在用自己的身体做实验......可你的状态真的不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于血液的研究而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石感染不了我，早在它还只是能源项目的时候便设下了保险。也许利用这一点，可以缓和矿石病的病症。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有特蕾西娅。她和你不一样，“文明的存续”本身不是什么强大的魔法，她只是靠着无数传承，创作了最根本的源石技艺形态。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许有她的帮助，我们可以研制出更进一步、可持续生产的矿石病药物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，我更担心你的状态，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然源石已经把你们塑造成了与我们相差无几的形态，那么，总能找到替代我身体的办法制造血清......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论眼下的问题有多么复杂，只要巴别塔能拿出有效的矿石病药物，支持我们的萨卡兹......不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整片大地上支持巴别塔的人将会不计其数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了那时，我们就可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，听我说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凯尔希猛地抓住了博士的手腕。\n她隐约察觉到，博士的手腕纤细了许多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从雷姆必拓之旅到萨卡兹内战，你从未有一刻放松过自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我决定将你唤醒，是我希望你能为这片文明......这片令我越发意外、越发惊喜，也越发无所适从的文明指明出路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我不希望你在此刻透支自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你该更爱惜你自己一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过现在，我更想减轻阿米娅的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三个月后\n卡兹戴尔地区，巴别塔罗德岛本舰"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......阿米娅，我看到你了，出来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......我、我是不是打扰你了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没，只是我刚刚没有听到门打开，有些好奇你是怎么进来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我发现了很多秘密通道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "秘密通道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对呀，可露希尔小姐让我保密，所以我一直没有告诉别人，只告诉博士你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪不得好几次凯尔希医生抓你检查的时候都找不到你，原来你偷偷躲到那里面去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......要是博士陪我一起去，我保证一定不会乱跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。我以后会尽量抽时间的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你最近真的很忙，连凯尔希医生都说，能见你面的次数越来越少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你总是一个人......带着很厚很厚的文件，低着头从走廊这头走到那头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家和你打招呼，你就点点头，一句话不说，然后就头也不回地离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，我听起来似乎很没有礼貌啊。对不起，阿米娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是的，博士......我不是那个意思，我、我只是觉得你很不开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么会这么想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还没有来到罗德岛的时候，博士对什么都有兴趣，和驮兽挤在一起睡觉，蹲在矿洞里盯着小石头发呆，去循兽的洞里掏果子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕是连我都觉得幼稚的事情，你也会很开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在......每次我和你分享很有趣的事情，你都只是说“只要阿米娅开心就够了”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可其实，我是为了让博士开心才和你讲的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是因为我的身体一直没有好起来，所以博士才不开心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是阿米娅的原因，是我自己的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......阿米娅偶尔也能听见舰外的动静，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......和雷姆必拓的超大钻井机一样......很吵闹，很讨厌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我、特蕾西娅小姐、凯尔希医生，都有很多事情要忙。并不是阿米娅的错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，阿米娅今天有空吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想去甲板上看看云，一会儿要下雨了，它们的形状很特殊，如果有人愿意听，我可能会讲很多很多话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我愿意听！可......博士不是还有工作要做吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系......很快就会结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g14_rhodesdeck_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没事的，博士只是过度劳累，晕倒在甲板上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......没有其他事情，那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士胳膊上的伤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在尝试让自己感染矿石病。尝试了很多办法，粉尘吸入，暴露在富源石环境中，甚至是直接用活性源石划破皮肤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我劝过了，也试着让Scout他们劝说博士停止。但博士还是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有人想看见他受伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也许博士比表露出的还要纠结痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅那孩子呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她都吓死了，哭个不停，好不容易才哄她入睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？这是......一个小石雕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是被拯救的感染者留给博士的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ace第一个听见阿米娅的呼喊，他把博士抱回这里的时候，顺手留下了这份感谢博士的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士，看吧，你已经和很多人建立了联系，早已不是孤独一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可到底有什么事情，你甚至不愿意对我和凯尔希倾诉呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士帮助阿米娅，帮助巴别塔的心情没有虚假，我能感觉得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我始终都觉得，博士还有一些未说出口的想法，一些顾虑，一些疑惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本以为是因为博士被唤醒得仓促，那些情感假以时日就会消散......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，没有，凯尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士正在被某些未说出口的话语撕扯。在犹豫，在痛苦，在自责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很惭愧，也许我并没有自己想的那么了解这个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道怎么才能缓解博士的痛苦，如果连你我都无法了解他的想法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么无论受到怎样的爱戴和敬畏，巴别塔的博士依旧是孑然一身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凯尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事后我会向博士解释的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西娅将手放在了博士的额前。\n滚烫的额头下，装着一段她无法想象的过去。\n“文明的存续”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这是，源石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这到底是......什么时候的记忆？博士的情感，痛苦、犹豫，以及......恐惧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个在绝望之中陪伴博士的人......是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。凯尔希曾说过的。她曾说过另一个——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石的生长悄无声息。美好。平静。\n生命的痕迹已被掩埋，文明也已在这片大地销声匿迹。\n可特蕾西娅能感受到的，只有恐惧和窒息。\n记忆在颤动，在崩溃。一股力量试图修正错误。\n记忆中的源石不断生长，甚至足以同化特蕾西娅的意识——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“特蕾西娅......”\n是凯尔希？对了，凯尔希还陪在自己的身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“特蕾西娅！”\n在自己的思维彻底陷入那团暧昧的源石光芒之前，她好像看到了博士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅，你怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看见了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......看见了源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石，同化了整片大地......博士，为此感到痛苦和不安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是博士的记忆吗？不......那是......一个梦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希......扶我一下，那种感受，那其中的杂音和哭嚎......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......特蕾西娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾经对你说过......源石，曾决定着这片大地遥远的未来。而选项，有两个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们太过关注具体的伤痛，天灾、矿石病。遥望那个未来，艰难，而且意义匮乏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士曾选择其一，是博士曾......亲口与我诉说的那个未来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我忘不了那个未来。忘不了博士所说过的话，这么多年来，一直都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而与之对应的，另一个空虚而冰寒的想法，在这万年的岁月里，总是在半夜化作凉意，钻入我的脊髓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我无法开口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是你可以通过魔王的力量意识到我的......愤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这其实也说明了，“文明的存续”并不在语言所设的桎梏之内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，特蕾西娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你看见了一个你不愿接受的未来，我希望你，也只有你，只有“文明的存续”能扭转结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......无论是我，还是博士，如果你看见了我们陌生的那一面......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，凯尔希！我并不是那个意思——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——博士对阿米娅，对我们，对你的情感，并没有虚假，这绝非谎言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相信博士吧，也相信我，那些造成博士痛苦的原因，我会亲自去寻找答案，到那时——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......！你醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎么了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在和阿米娅离开甲板的时候，你突然昏倒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，阿米娅呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "受到了一点惊吓，已经没事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的状态还是很不好，你在想什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
